OL,3,GNEWSAEx-watchdog told she would
OL,4,A'destroy peace process'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police ombudsman was told she
OL,7,Fwould "destroy the peace process" if
OL,8,Fshe published a report into the RUC's
OL,9,Finvestigation of the Omagh bomb, an
OL,10,Finquiry has heard.
OL,12,FThe 1998 bombing in the County Tyrone
OL,13,Ftown had the highest death toll of any
OL,14,Fsingle attack during the Troubles,
OL,15,Fkilling 29 people including a woman
OL,16,Fpregnant with twins.
OL,18,FIn 2001 there was a very public fall
OL,19,Fout between the Chief Constable of the
OL,20,FRoyal Ulster Constabulary (RUC) Sir
OL,21,FRonnie Flanagan and the then Police
OL,22,FOmbudsman Nuala O'Loan.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
