OL,3,GNEWSAEx-watchdog told she would
OL,4,A'destroy peace process'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer report, published in December of
OL,7,Fthat year, was heavily critical of the
OL,8,Fconduct of the RUC and in particular
OL,9,Fits then chief constable and assistant
OL,10,Fchief constable.
